      "evidence_extract": "Retained SCDS404B, revised November 2022. Table 6-1 (index 2, printed 3) gives the WQFN pads: S1 1, VSS 2, GND 3, S4 4, D4 5, SEL4 6, SEL3 7, D3 8, S3 9, FF 10, VDD 11, S2 12, D2 13, SEL2 14, SEL1 15, D1 16; the thermal pad is not connected internally (GND or VSS recommended). The TSSOP PW package is marked Preview (index 0). The package option addendum (index 40) lists TMUX7412FRRPR as Active, Production, WQFN (RRP) 16, 3000 LARGE T&R. Drawing 4224816/A (index 44-46) gives the RRP0016A outline, land example and stencil."
